     A*** GENERIC FIELDS **********************************************
     A            NWFL01    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Pend Upload Bills?')
     A*
     A*            Valid values are "Y", "N" or blanks where "Y" means
     A*            pend bills and "N" or blank means complete bills.
     A*
     A            NWFL02    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A*** BEG ADD *** 12/14/10 ****************************************
     A                                      COLHDG('Provider agreement')
     A*            Valid values: If its an Alliance contract then 'P'
     A*                          If any other network then 'Y'
     A*                          If no network then 'N'
     A*** END ADD *** 12/14/10 ****************************************
     A            NWFL03    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A*** Beg Chg *** 01/19/15 ****************************************
     A                                      COLHDG('Bill Upload.' +
     A                                      'Allow Inactive' +
     A                                      'Providers')
     A*** End Chg *** 01/19/15 ****************************************
